        "capture once, then socket-denied replay at serial/1/2/4: source sequence, acquired and final SHA-256, and the survivor of a synthetic cross-board twin identical to serial",
        "live arms serial/2/4 on one host, 2 passes at different hours: wall, summed board seconds, per-board median/p95/max, failure categories, retries, 429s, peak RSS",
        "whether an Ashby straggler recurs, and what it costs serial vs 4 workers when it is not the last board",
        "never above 4 workers; stop on any 429 or new failure category"
      ],
      "not_justified": {
        "breezy": "3 boards, 2.45 s"
